286
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,280
One player puts on a blindfold

287
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:32,560
and sits in the guessing chair.

288
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,440
(Guess Who's Breathing)
Of the other seven players,

289
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:36,680
one randomly makes a sound.

290
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:39,080
The guesser must identify who made it.

291
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:40,600
If they guess right,

292
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:41,400
they switch places

293
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:43,240
with whoever made the sound.

294
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:44,560
If they guess wrong,

295
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:47,360
they get whacked with
an inflatable hammer and keep guessing.

296
00:11:47,680 --> 00:11:50,040
The game lasts ten minutes.
When time's up,

297
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:51,680
whoever's still

298
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:53,480
in the guessing chair

299
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:54,800
will get

300
00:11:54,800 --> 00:11:57,320
the first group beatdown of the fall.

301
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:59,200
You really won't let me
leave with dignity.

302
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:02,680
There's someone who's
been hitting everyone,

303
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:03,760
but he

304
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:04,600
hasn't been hit once.

305
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:05,680
Jingyu, take a seat.

306
00:12:05,780 --> 00:12:07,260
(That came out of nowhere)

307
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:07,880
Jingyu.

308
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:12,360
What a twist.

309
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:16,680
Jingyu's always sending people flying.

310
00:12:17,520 --> 00:12:18,760
Now everyone can...

311
00:12:18,760 --> 00:12:19,800
Yank his chair?

312
00:12:22,220 --> 00:12:23,300
(Can't wait to try)

313
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:25,200
Wait, isn't this just him
getting beaten up?

314
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:26,320
How is he supposed to guess?

315
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:29,040
Does it hurt?

316
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:30,440
Not really.

317
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:33,040
It's fine. Let's go!

318
00:12:33,300 --> 00:12:34,200
(Game officially starts)

319
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:34,720
Okay.

320
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,680
(Emergency hammer recall)
Wait. You can't just hit him.

321
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:41,040
Make a sound first.

322
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:42,320
You hit him if he guesses wrong.

323
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,240
You're not letting me guess?

324
00:12:45,620 --> 00:12:47,380
(Of course we are)

325
00:12:55,640 --> 00:12:56,200
Fan Chengcheng.

326
00:12:58,700 --> 00:12:59,940
(Over before it even started)

327
00:12:59,980 --> 00:13:00,780
(Stunned)

328
00:13:02,540 --> 00:13:03,500
(That easy?)

329
00:13:03,500 --> 00:13:04,500
(That's it?)

330
00:13:04,540 --> 00:13:05,900
(How'd he do that?)

331
00:13:07,040 --> 00:13:07,720
No, Jingyu.

332
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,960
I just wanted to get you out of there.

333
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:09,980
(Smooth talking)
I didn't want you getting hit.

334
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:13,760
See how good I am to you, Jingyu?

335
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:14,500
(Please spare me)

336
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:23,760
Bai.

337
00:13:23,780 --> 00:13:24,700
(Confident for no reason)

338
00:13:25,300 --> 00:13:25,900
(Hit him)

339
00:13:25,900 --> 00:13:26,660
(No mercy)

340
00:13:28,300 --> 00:13:29,740
(Got him)

341
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:34,000
You knocked his blindfold off.

342
00:13:35,220 --> 00:13:37,140
(You or me?)

343
00:13:37,140 --> 00:13:38,340
(Go)

344
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:47,520
Hu.

345
00:13:49,900 --> 00:13:50,900
(Clenched teeth, muscles tensed)

346
00:13:53,340 --> 00:13:54,540
(Holding his breath)

347
00:13:55,220 --> 00:13:56,180
(Caught off guard)

348
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:05,920
I gotta stretch my neck a bit,

349
00:14:05,920 --> 00:14:07,240
or that hammer might hit it.

350
00:14:12,780 --> 00:14:13,900
(Always ready)

351
00:14:14,280 --> 00:14:14,720
Bai.

352
00:14:22,300 --> 00:14:23,820
(Ready to strike)
Sounds familiar.

353
00:14:24,540 --> 00:14:25,980
(Is he about to guess it?)

354
00:14:26,540 --> 00:14:27,940
(Can barely hold back)

355
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:30,240
Teng.

356
00:14:30,300 --> 00:14:31,540
(Charging up.jpg)

357
00:14:43,740 --> 00:14:44,460
(I'm ready)

358
00:14:48,220 --> 00:14:49,060
(Almost made a sound)

359
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:52,080
Teng.

360
00:14:52,420 --> 00:14:53,380
(Fast, precise, steady)

361
00:14:59,320 --> 00:14:59,920
Bing.

362
00:15:00,220 --> 00:15:01,340
(Just waiting for you to guess wrong)

363
00:15:08,580 --> 00:15:10,060
(Shutting down)

364
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:11,240
He hasn't gotten a single one right?

365
00:15:12,060 --> 00:15:13,260
(Way to rub it in)

366
00:15:23,860 --> 00:15:28,900
(Oh no. This is bad)

367
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:30,680
Jingyu!

368
00:15:30,900 --> 00:15:32,860
(Now we're talking)

369
00:15:35,180 --> 00:15:36,860
(He still got it wrong?)

370
00:15:42,220 --> 00:15:43,620
(Guessing is so hard)

371
00:15:45,900 --> 00:15:46,980
(Your turn)

372
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:50,240
Wang Churan.

373
00:15:59,580 --> 00:16:00,740
(Hammer at the ready)

374
00:16:01,280 --> 00:16:02,040
Wang Churan.

375
00:16:06,300 --> 00:16:07,420
(Finally)

376
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:11,360
You must've taken over a dozen hits.

377
00:16:12,020 --> 00:16:14,500
(Too painful to talk about)

378
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:16,380
(Handed it over without thinking)
I almost swung.

379
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:17,480
Why are you giving me this?

380
00:16:17,880 --> 00:16:19,180
(Don't drag me into this)
Why give it to me now?

381
00:16:19,180 --> 00:16:19,740
(Quickly hands it back)

382
00:16:19,780 --> 00:16:20,640
(Still hasn't caught on)

383
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:21,120
Get up.

384
00:16:21,740 --> 00:16:23,300
(System rebooting)

385
00:16:24,540 --> 00:16:25,540
(When did that happen?)

386
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,440
Now you're giving it to me?

387
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:32,680
Put it on.

388
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:39,540
(Gotcha)

389
00:16:42,980 --> 00:16:44,220
(Always ready)

390
00:16:44,920 --> 00:16:45,440
Lin.

391
00:16:50,580 --> 00:16:51,260
(Seriously?)

392
00:16:51,520 --> 00:16:53,400
(I actually got it right?)
How'd you guess that?

393
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:54,720
How'd you figure it out?

394
00:16:54,720 --> 00:16:56,060
(First try)
I just guessed.

395
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:57,840
Not a single hit. That's amazing.

396
00:17:01,700 --> 00:17:02,820
(Not laughing anymore)

397
00:17:03,800 --> 00:17:05,920
Let's see what's harder,
your hammer or my head.

398
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:06,400
Come on.

399
00:17:07,110 --> 00:17:07,520
Sir,

400
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:08,760
the hammer, obviously.

401
00:17:10,070 --> 00:17:10,880
Hit him in the mouth.

402
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:12,300
(His mouth's the toughest part of him)

403
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:15,880
Teng.

404
00:17:23,720 --> 00:17:24,350
Teng.

405
00:17:27,160 --> 00:17:28,500
Give me that hammer. Come on.

406
00:17:28,500 --> 00:17:29,420
(I'll handle this one myself)

407
00:17:29,660 --> 00:17:31,300
(Big mistake)

408
00:17:31,560 --> 00:17:33,840
I've got a score to settle.
Let me get even.

409
00:17:34,340 --> 00:17:35,340
(Now I'm in charge)

410
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:36,520
Take it. Quick.

411
00:17:38,940 --> 00:17:40,340
(Stretching begins)
Chengcheng.

412
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:44,120
Teng's neck isn't in great shape.

413
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:44,960
(Such a nice guy)
Maybe hit his mouth instead?

414
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:46,580
(Or maybe not)

415
00:17:48,060 --> 00:17:49,380
(That look says it all)

416
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:51,800
Here, let's hold his neck steady.

417
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:53,400
It's fine.

418
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:54,420
Hit me.

419
00:17:54,420 --> 00:17:55,000
(I can take it)

420
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:55,960
Just hit you?

421
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:56,720
No need to play?

422
00:18:02,260 --> 00:18:03,620
(Will he...)

423
00:18:03,620 --> 00:18:05,260
(Get it on the first try?)

424
00:18:05,300 --> 00:18:06,900
(Gripping tight)

425
00:18:06,940 --> 00:18:08,700
(Thinking.jpg)

426
00:18:08,720 --> 00:18:09,640
Huang Jingyu.

427
00:18:09,900 --> 00:18:11,380
(Here's my chance)

428
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:20,000
What?

429
00:18:26,560 --> 00:18:27,280
Fan Chengcheng.

430
00:18:27,700 --> 00:18:28,900
(Secret)

431
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:34,920
Come on.

432
00:18:35,740 --> 00:18:37,380
(Chengcheng strikes again)

433
00:18:41,660 --> 00:18:42,340
(What was that noise?)

434
00:18:42,340 --> 00:18:43,460
(Can't hold it in anymore)

435
00:18:43,820 --> 00:18:45,620
(Holding back laughter)

436
00:18:45,800 --> 00:18:46,480
Bing.

437
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:51,960
Is this game just about beating me up?

438
00:18:53,640 --> 00:18:54,360
Bing.

439
00:18:56,960 --> 00:18:57,680
Bai.

440
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:04,320
Bai.

441
00:19:10,580 --> 00:19:11,940
(Didn't see that coming, did you?)

442
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:13,920
He tricked you.

443
00:19:16,620 --> 00:19:17,560
(Your turn)

444
00:19:17,560 --> 00:19:19,840
I mean, I've got nothing against him.

445
00:19:19,840 --> 00:19:20,640
You guys go ahead.

446
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:21,920
Someone who does.

447
00:19:23,900 --> 00:19:25,140
(You'll regret handing it to me)

448
00:19:25,320 --> 00:19:26,960
He's trying to make enemies
with everyone.

449
00:19:31,360 --> 00:19:32,840
Does wearing it
like that affect your hearing?

450
00:19:33,520 --> 00:19:34,600
My ears are still out.

451
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:41,940
(Hiss, burp)

452
00:19:42,040 --> 00:19:43,320
Why were there two people?

453
00:19:44,840 --> 00:19:48,600
That was just a coincidence.

454
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:52,920
Hu Xianxu.

455
00:19:56,580 --> 00:19:57,940
(Finding the perfect angle)

456
00:20:15,800 --> 00:20:16,280
Bing.

457
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:19,340
(He got it already?)

458
00:20:19,800 --> 00:20:21,000
Not bad.

459
00:20:22,840 --> 00:20:23,780
How'd you do that?

460
00:20:23,780 --> 00:20:24,260
(Hu is baffled)

461
00:20:24,980 --> 00:20:25,660
(How's that possible?)

462
00:20:26,540 --> 00:20:27,180
(Take notes)

463
00:20:31,360 --> 00:20:31,920
Huang Jingyu.

464
00:20:36,080 --> 00:20:37,320
Go easy on the cologne!

465
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:40,880
You know Jingyu by his scent?

466
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:41,980
(Jingyu's cologne arrives
before his voice)

467
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,080
I slipped up.

468
00:20:50,960 --> 00:20:51,800
Give everyone a sniff.

469
00:20:51,800 --> 00:20:52,880
I don't wear any. I don't.

470
00:20:53,320 --> 00:20:55,440
He's not playing a cop anymore.

471
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:57,240
Now he's playing a police dog.

472
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:01,600
Guess he can't get any cop roles.

473
00:21:04,080 --> 00:21:04,680
Let's go.

474
00:21:05,240 --> 00:21:06,600
(Making a game plan)
Every wrong guess, we hit him.

475
00:21:06,600 --> 00:21:08,080
We'll stand on either side.

476
00:21:09,700 --> 00:21:10,180
(Your turn)

477
00:21:10,180 --> 00:21:10,980
(Click)

478
00:21:12,940 --> 00:21:13,620
(Click)

479
00:21:14,280 --> 00:21:14,960
Which sound?

480
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:17,640
Fan Chengcheng.

481
00:21:19,260 --> 00:21:20,980
(Guessed right yet again)

482
00:21:22,080 --> 00:21:22,840
I got it again?

483
00:21:23,480 --> 00:21:24,280
What kind of trick was that?

484
00:21:25,400 --> 00:21:27,080
I thought we were gonna
hammer away like blacksmiths.

485
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:32,000
Who knew he'd be so slow to react?

486
00:21:33,100 --> 00:21:34,340
(Guess I'm just too good)

487
00:21:35,080 --> 00:21:36,480
We're taking your suggestion.

488
00:21:36,480 --> 00:21:38,240
We're taking it.

489
00:21:39,880 --> 00:21:41,480
I almost feel bad hitting Chengcheng.

490
00:21:42,650 --> 00:21:43,640
Oh my God.

491
00:21:48,020 --> 00:21:48,940
(Charging in)

492
00:21:49,920 --> 00:21:50,520
Hu.

493
00:21:52,440 --> 00:21:52,960
Hu.

494
00:21:54,720 --> 00:21:55,360
Li Yunrui.

495
00:21:55,360 --> 00:21:56,560
(Conductor
of the inflatable hammer orchestra)

496
00:21:56,560 --> 00:21:57,200
Bing.

497
00:21:58,480 --> 00:21:59,080
Teng.

498
00:22:01,700 --> 00:22:02,940
(Watering the little flower)

499
00:22:05,920 --> 00:22:07,760
Who spat on the back of my neck?

500
00:22:17,840 --> 00:22:19,520
Who's playing so dirty?

501
00:22:20,160 --> 00:22:20,840
Who?

502
00:22:20,840 --> 00:22:21,760
Me.

503
00:22:22,080 --> 00:22:23,320
I laughed and it just flew out.

504
00:22:23,700 --> 00:22:25,220
(Really couldn't help it)

505
00:22:26,600 --> 00:22:28,240
I'm getting old.

506
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:29,160
My lips don't seal properly.

507
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:30,140
(I didn't mean to)

508
00:22:31,030 --> 00:22:31,420
My neck...

509
00:22:36,660 --> 00:22:39,660
(Laughing this hard actually hurts)

510
00:22:39,860 --> 00:22:40,780
(Back to the mission)

511
00:22:40,780 --> 00:22:42,020
(Switching positions)

512
00:22:43,380 --> 00:22:45,060
(Getting into position)

513
00:22:45,320 --> 00:22:46,840
You're not all gonna spit
on me, are you?

514
00:22:46,860 --> 00:22:48,140
(Terrified)

515
00:22:52,560 --> 00:22:53,360
Lin.

516
00:22:54,280 --> 00:22:55,080
Hu.

517
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:56,440
Teng.

518
00:22:57,720 --> 00:22:58,480
Teng.

519
00:23:00,360 --> 00:23:01,000
Wang Churan.

520
00:23:01,060 --> 00:23:02,780
(Getting whacked no matter what)

521
00:23:03,580 --> 00:23:04,300
(Can't stop swinging)

522
00:23:06,860 --> 00:23:08,140
(Here to celebrate)

523
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:11,920
We got too caught up

524
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:12,960
in the rhythm of blacksmithing.

525
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:14,080
I got carried away with the beat.

526
00:23:14,100 --> 00:23:14,980
(A true rhythm master)

527
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:16,560
I got a little too into it.

528
00:23:16,560 --> 00:23:17,360
Way too into it.

529
00:23:19,040 --> 00:23:20,120
That's what you call
getting carried away.

530
00:23:23,420 --> 00:23:25,300
(Begging forgiveness with a hammer)

531
00:23:25,320 --> 00:23:27,120
He's playing this pretty smart.

532
00:23:27,120 --> 00:23:27,760
He never steps up.

533
00:23:27,760 --> 00:23:28,960
He just keeps hitting people.

534
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:30,640
He won't be named.

535
00:23:30,640 --> 00:23:31,120
You know?

536
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:41,200
Jingyu.

537
00:23:42,260 --> 00:23:43,500
(Here comes Jingyu)

538
00:23:43,760 --> 00:23:44,600
Lin.

539
00:23:45,220 --> 00:23:45,900
(Here comes Lin)

540
00:23:45,900 --> 00:23:47,620
(Ask and you shall receive)

541
00:23:47,680 --> 00:23:48,320
Fan Chengcheng.

542
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:56,920
Teng.

543
00:23:57,720 --> 00:23:58,960
Thirty seconds left.

544
00:23:58,960 --> 00:24:00,960
Whoever's still in the chair

545
00:24:01,400 --> 00:24:03,280
gets the first beatdown of the autumn.

546
00:24:03,800 --> 00:24:04,480
Hurry.

547
00:24:09,280 --> 00:24:09,840
Lin.

548
00:24:13,280 --> 00:24:13,880
Hu.

549
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:22,120
Quick!

550
00:24:22,560 --> 00:24:23,400
Hurry.

551
00:24:25,760 --> 00:24:26,600
Chengcheng.

552
00:24:27,600 --> 00:24:28,620
(Take that)
Isn't that Chengcheng?

553
00:24:39,760 --> 00:24:40,400
Teng.

554
00:24:43,840 --> 00:24:44,760
Four seconds left.

555
00:24:45,360 --> 00:24:46,320
Bring it on.

556
00:24:46,320 --> 00:24:47,960
The first beatdown of the fall.

557
00:24:48,340 --> 00:24:48,900
(You sit)

558
00:24:48,900 --> 00:24:49,740
(No, you)

559
00:24:49,740 --> 00:24:50,580
(Be good)

560
00:24:52,500 --> 00:24:53,580
(Come on, keep going)

561
00:24:54,540 --> 00:24:55,700
(Already trying to get out of it)

562
00:24:57,060 --> 00:24:58,740
(Shy)

563
00:25:03,180 --> 00:25:06,700
(His conscience kicks in)

564
00:25:06,920 --> 00:25:07,720
I can only...

565
00:25:07,720 --> 00:25:09,320
I can only guess it right away.

566
00:25:10,360 --> 00:25:11,560
You're so annoying.

567
00:25:11,560 --> 00:25:12,880
(Already forgot
how he felt ten seconds ago)

568
00:25:12,880 --> 00:25:13,680
Finishing blow.

569
00:25:18,380 --> 00:25:19,940
(Quickly memorizing
everyone's positions)

570
00:25:19,960 --> 00:25:21,160
Checking who's got a motive.

571
00:25:22,060 --> 00:25:24,460
(Trying to switch places)

572
00:25:25,940 --> 00:25:26,900
(Oops. Eye contact)

573
00:25:27,700 --> 00:25:29,180
(The eyes beneath the eyes,
replay edition)

574
